@startuml
' Source: ../apollo-timer-architecture.drawio (page 08c-tfa-delay-sequence)
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK KR
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantBorderColor #235D86
  ParticipantFontColor #172C43
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ArrowColor #235D86
  ArrowFontColor #172C43
  MessageAlign center
  ParticipantPadding 10
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor #94A3B8
scale max 790 width

participant "Firmware caller" as p0
participant "Delay / Timeout API" as p1
participant "Generic delay timer" as p2
participant "CPU Counter register" as p3

p0 -> p1 : 1. udelay(usec)
p1 -> p2 : 2. get_timer_value()
p2 -> p3 : 3. MRS CNTPCT · ~count의 low 32-bit
p1 -> p1 : 4. target = ceil(usec × div / mult) + 1
p1 -> p3 : 5. 반복 read · start − current ≥ target까지
p1 -> p0 : 6. delay 완료 후 반환
note over p0, p3
Timeout API: deadline 생성과 만료 확인은 별도 호출
end note
p0 -> p1 : 7. timeout_init_us(usec)
p1 -> p3 : 8. CNTPCT + floor(usec × CNTFRQ / 1,000,000)
p0 -> p1 : 9. timeout_elapsed(deadline)
p1 -> p3 : 10. CNTPCT > deadline 비교 → bool 반환

@enduml
